#: resources/quest/quest.json:874
msgid ""
"请按照如下步骤设置:\n"
"1 购买9999个鹤嘴锄并保存在仓库里\n"
"2 六人队伍脱掉所有装备, 然后尽可能多的携带鹤嘴锄\n"
"3 在王城的工会里新建一个队伍, 并命名为FFXIStone.\n"
"4 前往活动地图2F, 在哈肯正对的矿点前, 打上标记.\n"
"5 确保这是该层唯一的标记.\n"
"6 副本或主城中启动脚本.\n"
"\n"
"Please follow these steps to set it up:\n"
"1 Purchase 9,999 pickaxes.\n"
"2 Have your six-person party remove all equipment, then carry as many pickaxes as possible.\n"
"3 Create a new party at the Guild in the Royal City and name it \"FFXIStone\".\n"
"4 Go to the 2nd floor and place a marker at the mining place directly facing Harken.\n"
"5 Ensure this is the only marker on that floor.\n"
"6 Start the script while in the dungeon or the city."
msgstr ""
"请按照如下步骤设置:\n"
"1 购买9999个鹤嘴锄并保存在仓库里\n"
"2 六人队伍脱掉所有装备, 然后尽可能多的携带鹤嘴锄\n"
"3 在王城的工会里新建一个队伍, 并命名为FFXIStone.\n"
"4 前往活动地图2F, 在哈肯正对的矿点前, 打上标记.\n"
"5 确保这是该层唯一的标记.\n"
"6 副本或主城中启动脚本."

#: src/script.py
msgid "检测到猎人的陷阱设置画面. 返回关闭后继续恢复."
msgstr "检测到猎人的陷阱设置画面. 返回关闭后继续恢复."

#: CHANGES_LOG.md:3
msgid "修复了战斗中next无法点击的问题."
msgstr "修复了战斗中next无法点击的问题."

#: CHANGES_LOG.md:4
msgid "修复了偶发的无法识别到镐子数量不足的问题."
msgstr "修复了偶发的无法识别到镐子数量不足的问题."

#: CHANGES_LOG.md:5
msgid "Fixed an issue where the script failed to launch due to an incorrect English quest name."
msgstr "Fixed an issue where the script failed to launch due to an incorrect English quest name."

#: CHANGES_LOG.md:6
msgid "Added English descriptions for the mining quest. Enjoy!"
msgstr "Added English descriptions for the mining quest. Enjoy!"

msgid "Integrated upstream 2.5.11 mining-position checks and restart recovery."
msgstr "已合并上游2.5.11的采矿位置检查和重启恢复。"

msgid "Improved the combat Next target image and mining result detection."
msgstr "改进了战斗Next目标图片和采矿结果识别。"

msgid "Preserved Telegram control, persistent settings, and network recovery."
msgstr "保留了Telegram控制、设置持久化和网络恢复功能。"

msgid "Simplified route-readiness detection so slow screenshots do not misclassify transient route errors."
msgstr "简化了路线准备检测，避免慢截图将短暂的路线错误误判为失败。"

msgid "Added a recovery boundary so mining can continue after a game restart during dungeon entry."
msgstr "增加了恢复边界，使游戏在进入副本时重启后仍可继续采矿。"

msgid "Mining results are now checked in both the pre-click and post-click frames."
msgstr "现在会在点击前和点击后的画面中检查采矿结果。"

msgid "Updated the Next image and mining-result detection."
msgstr "更新了Next图片和采矿结果检测。"

msgid "Centralized diagnostic screenshots and adjusted the mining wait interval."
msgstr "统一了诊断截图保存方式并调整了采矿等待间隔。"

msgid "Combat now uses bounded fallback targeting when the Next marker remains visible."
msgstr "当Next标记仍然可见时，战斗现在会使用有界的备用目标选择。"

